# 管理者の権限の一時的な昇格 (design 8.7.2), for tools/ui_run.py: ネットワーク設定 is
# started from its program as the desktop starts it, and acts as 利用者; its settings
# are the administrator's, so writing them asks the desktop for the administrator's
# password. On a disk whose 管理者 has none yet, the panel asks for one to be chosen
# (typed twice; Tab goes to the second box); then a wrong one is refused and the right
# one let; then the panel is put away and the settings are not written. The window
# of ネットワーク設定 is at 200,120, its box 自ホスト at 405,222; Ctrl+S is 設定を更新,
# and Enter agrees to its question. The password panel is over the desktop's own
# window, which holds the keys while it is up.
open 01a0d8c4-52b5-7a41-8c61-2d7e9f0a1b31
expect netenv: ready
wait 800
click 405 222
text kthost
wait 300
key 16 01
wait 800
key 28
wait 1000
shot adm_choose
text ktest-admin
key 2b
text ktest-admin
wait 300
key 28
expect the administrator's password was set
expect the administrator's rights for process
expect netenv: written
wait 500
# the second time: a wrong password told, the right one let
click 405 222
text 2
key 16 01
wait 800
key 28
wait 1000
shot adm_ask
text wrong
key 28
expect password typed wrong (1)
wait 800
shot adm_wrong
key 28
wait 800
text ktest-admin
key 28
expect netenv: written
wait 500
# the third time: the panel put away, nothing written and nothing more said
wait 1500
click 405 222
text 3
key 16 01
wait 1500
key 28
wait 1000
key 29
expect : not asked
expect netenv: not written: no right
wait 500
shot adm_cancel
